<Base title="Privacy policy | VibeVerdict" description="How VibeVerdict handles analytics, cookies, the Beehiiv newsletter, affiliate links, and future Google AdSense advertising.">
<h1>Privacy policy</h1>
<p class="mut">Last updated 15 October 2026.</p>
<p>VibeVerdict is an editorial site about AI tools. This page explains what we collect, what third parties may collect, and how to reach us. Contact: <a href="mailto:hello@vibeverdict.ai">hello@vibeverdict.ai</a>.</p>

<h2>What we collect</h2>
<p>The site itself is static. Visiting a page does not require an account, and we do not ask you to create one. If you email us, we receive whatever you send, including your address and message, and we use it only to reply.</p>

<h2>Analytics</h2>
<p>We may use analytics to count visits, see which pages are used, and notice broken traffic. Analytics can record a page address, approximate location derived from your IP address, browser type, and a similar technical identifier. We use that to understand the site, not to sell a profile of you. If an analytics tool sets a cookie, it is covered by the cookie choice below.</p>

<h2>Cookies and on-device storage</h2>
<p>A cookie is a small file a site stores in your browser. This site also uses local storage, which stays on your device. We store your cookie choice there under the key <code>vv-cookie-consent</code>, as either accepted or declined. That record is not sent to an ad network.</p>
<p>The banner at the bottom of the page asks you to accept or decline optional cookies. Declining means we do not treat you as opted in to advertising cookies. Essential storage is only the choice itself, so we do not ask you again on every page. You can clear the choice by clearing this site's data in your browser.</p>

<h2>Newsletter via Beehiiv</h2>
<p>The weekly newsletter is optional. The signup box sends your email address to <a href="https://www.beehiiv.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Beehiiv</a>, which delivers the list. Beehiiv processes that address under its own privacy policy: <a href="https://www.beehiiv.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">beehiiv.com/privacy</a>. We use the address to send the newsletter and related notes you asked for. Unsubscribe from any issue. We do not sell the list.</p>

<h2>Affiliate links</h2>
<p>Some outbound links are affiliate links. If you continue to a vendor or an affiliate network, that site may set its own cookies so the network knows the visit came from VibeVerdict. Those cookies belong to that site, not to us. A commission never changes a verdict. Details are in the <a href="/disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a>.</p>

<h2>Future Google AdSense</h2>
<p>We may show ads from Google AdSense later. We do not load AdSense, or any other ad script, today. If we turn ads on, Google and its advertising partners may store and read cookies, including third-party cookies, on your browser. They use those cookies to serve ads, to limit how often you see an ad, and to measure whether an ad was viewed or clicked. Ads may be based on your visits to this site and to other sites.</p>
<p>You can opt out of personalized Google ads at <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">adssettings.google.com</a>. Declining cookies in our banner is a separate choice on this site. Google's own policy is at <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">policies.google.com/privacy</a>.</p>

<h2>Contact</h2>
<p>Questions about this policy: <a href="mailto:hello@vibeverdict.ai">hello@vibeverdict.ai</a>. The <a href="/contact/">contact page</a> has the same address.</p>
